64: /**
65:  * Builder class for {@link Reporter}.
66:  *
67:  * @param <REPORTER> Generic type of the reporter.
68:  * @param <SETUP> Generic type of the created setup.
69:  * @param <REPORTER_FACTORY> Generic type of the reporter factory.
